rule.world-rules.mobs_break_blocks.name=Mobs Break Blocks
rule.world-rules.mobs_break_blocks.hint=Creepers and ghast fireballs break blocks, and fireballs start fires. Off: they still hurt, but leave the world alone.
rule.world-rules.blasts_destroy_items.name=Blasts Destroy Items
rule.world-rules.blasts_destroy_items.hint=Explosions of any kind destroy items lying on the ground. Off: they only throw them.
rule.world-rules.keep_inventory.name=Keep Inventory
rule.world-rules.keep_inventory.hint=You keep everything you carry when you die.
rule.world-rules.sleeping.name=Sleeping
rule.world-rules.sleeping.hint=Beds put you to sleep. Off: a bed only sets your respawn point, at any hour, and the night goes on.
rule.world-rules.weather.name=Weather
rule.world-rules.weather.hint=Clear: it never rains. Rain or Snow: it never stops, and thunder comes and goes.
rule.world-rules.weather.normal=Normal
rule.world-rules.weather.clear=Clear
rule.world-rules.weather.rain=Rain or Snow
rule.world-rules.natural_monsters.name=Natural Monsters
rule.world-rules.natural_monsters.hint=Off: none appear by themselves. Unlike Peaceful, you don't heal on your own, and dungeons still spawn them.
rule.world-rules.monster_light.name=Monster Light
rule.world-rules.monster_light.hint=Beta: monsters appear in dim light. Dark Only: any torch or lava light stops them. Spawners stay as beta.
rule.world-rules.monster_light.beta=Beta
rule.world-rules.monster_light.none=Dark Only
rule.world-rules.apple_drops.name=Apple Drops
rule.world-rules.apple_drops.hint=Oak leaves sometimes drop an apple, broken or decayed, as in later versions. Not with shears.
rule.world-rules.falling_bonus.name=Falling Hit Bonus
rule.world-rules.falling_bonus.hint=Beta: half a heart more on any hit unless moving up, so nearly always. Fixed: only when really falling. Off: never.
rule.world-rules.falling_bonus.beta=Beta
rule.world-rules.falling_bonus.fixed=Fixed
rule.world-rules.falling_bonus.off=Off
rule.world-rules.bows_wear_out.name=Bows Wear Out
rule.world-rules.bows_wear_out.hint=Beta's bows never wore out. On: a bow lasts 385 shots, as when bows first wore out in 1.0.
rule.world-rules.pickup_reach.name=Pickup Reach
rule.world-rules.pickup_reach.hint=Beta: you pick up only items beside you. On: also half a block above and below, and all round what you ride.
